 EC 2026 - Paper submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Language Resources and Evaluation Conference\
 nWebsite: https://lrec2026.info/\nSource URL: https://lrec2026.info/third
 -call-for-papers/\nLocation: Palma de Mallorca\, Spain\nTopics: Natural L
 anguage Processing & LLMs\, Data Mining & Data Science\, Signal Processin
 g\nSize: XL\nSubmission type: Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast ch
 ecked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Archived full conference window includes w
 orkshops\; main sessions May 13-15. Resources\, datasets\, annotation and
  evaluation characterize the venue. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope
 : Language resources\, annotation\, corpora and datasets\, speech and mul
 timodal resources\, benchmarking\, and evaluation for human-language tech
 nologies. Contributions often create or analyze reusable resources and me
 thods for linguistic coverage and reliable assessment. The breadth of lan
 guage applications is summarized without treating every domain as a defin
 ing topic.\nAdditional topics: Multimedia Learning & Retrieval\, Fairness
  & Responsible AI\nScope sources (2026): https://lrec2026.info/third-call
