 Information Retrieval & Search\, Recommender Systems\, Graphs & Graph Lea
 rning\, LLM Agents & Tool Use\, Natural Language Processing & LLMs\nScope
  sources (2027): https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/cffp.html\nScope la
 st checked: 2026-10-07
